<title>BELGIUM: MOTOR RACING-BELGIAN GRAND PRIX RESULT.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-BELGIAN GRAND PRIX RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>SPA-FRANCORCHAMPS, Belgium 1996-08-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of</p>
<p>Sunday's Belgian Grand Prix motor race:</p>
<p>1. Michael Schumacher (Germany) Ferrari 1 hour 28 minutes</p>
<p>15.125 seconds (average speed 208.442 kph)</p>
<p> 2. Jacques Villeneuve (Canada) Williams     5.602 seconds</p>
<p>behind</p>
<p> 3. Mika Hakkinen (Finland) McLaren	   15.710</p>
<p> 4. Jean Alesi (France) Benetton		19.125</p>
<p> 5. Damon Hill (Britain) Williams	     29.179</p>
<p> 6. Gerhard Berger (Austria) Benetton	 29.896</p>
<p> 7. Mika Salo (Finland) Tyrrell	     1:00.754</p>
<p> 8. Ukyo Katayama (Japan) Tyrrell	   1:40.227</p>
<p> 9. Ricardo Rosset (Brazil) Arrows	  one lap</p>
<p> 10. Pedro Lamy (Portugal) Minardi	  one lap</p>
<p>Did not finish:</p>
